<title>USA: AutoLend bankruptcy filing dismissed.</title>
<headline>AutoLend bankruptcy filing dismissed.</headline>
<dateline>ALBUQUERQUE, N.M. 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>AutoLend Group Inc said the U.S. Bankruptcy Court for the District of New Mexico dismissed an involuntary bankruptcy petition filed by the company's creditors.</p>
<p>Shares of Autolend closed at 5/8, off 1/16 of a point, on 3,500 shares traded.</p>
